  "body": "What happens:\nThe bottom middle toolbar shows buttons without any labels or tooltips. A user cannot know what the buttons do without clicking them.\n\nExpected:\nA tooltip shows the button name and a short description when the user hovers the mouse over each button.\n\nEvidence:\nFound while learning the UI. The toolbar is at the bottom center of the main window.\n\nDone means:\nEach button in the bottom middle toolbar shows a tooltip on hover with the button name and a one-line description of its action.",
